==English==

===Etymology===
From English: face + palm (of one's hand).  Found primarily in real-time text communication on the Internet.

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|Media:en-us-facepalm.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To bring the palm of one's hand  to one's face in mixed humor and disbelief or digust. (e.g.: when one is caught off-guard with a particularly bad pun.)
# To bring one's face down to one's cupped hand or hands.